><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/1039f3da45c21a403d79115fecbbc11f.poster.avif?t=1680621823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/1039f3da45c21a403d79115fecbbc11f.webm?t=1680621823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/1039f3da45c21a403d79115fecbbc11f.mp4?t=1680621823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Everyone likes watching cute dogs in funny outfits, right? Well, now\u2019s your chance to trump all the cool photos you\u2019ve seen on the Internet! Choose from numerous items desired by every dog owner. From everyday stuff like collars, leashes, harnesses, and toys to hilarious or elegant costumes. Whether it\u2019s a distinguished tux and top-hat or a spider-like Halloween outfit - your pup will have some style to show off!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/31bb9c87cae52311fbe73667224bfbc6.webp?t=1680621823\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/f6ba8e54dedfd74708bc5cf087b46de4.poster.avif?t=1680621823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/f6ba8e54dedfd74708bc5cf087b46de4.webm?t=1680621823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113080/extras/f6ba8e54dedfd74708bc5cf087b46de4.mp4?t=1680621823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Put your training skills to the test and take part in a bunch of competitions with your dog. Prove your pet\u2019s obedience and extraordinary agility in a set of trail runs and guide him to becoming the champion! If your pup is more of a beauty queen, sign up for a beauty contest. Just as new trophies and medals will appear on your shelf, even more, difficult challenges will arise. Show everyone who\u2019s the best trainer!",
